<a name="oraclesid"/><h1>SID / Service Name</h1>

<p>The <i>sid</i> option restricts clients to the specified SID/SERVICE_NAME, or comma-separated list of them.  Others are refused with ORA-12514, and a client that names no SID/SERVICE_NAME at all is refused with ORA-12504.  If unset or an empty string, any SID/SERVICE_NAME is accepted.</p>

